  <running_head>IESVI / TARVM.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">Iesus dabat cunctis pacem,</l>
    <l n="2">edhi subdunt bellis facem,</l>
    <l n="3">Hi principum ficarij,</l>
    <l n="4">rbisq; incendiarij.</l>
    <l n="5">Iesus regna stabilivit,</l>
    <l n="6">egi Regis obedivit,</l>
    <l n="7">Cæsari tributum pendit,</l>
    <l n="8">um quid iuris sit oftendit.</l>
    <l n="9">Hi regnorum proditores,</l>
    <l n="10">tq; legum fraudatores,</l>
    <l n="11">Reges volunt iugulare,</l>
    <l n="12">sic plebem subiugare.</l>
    <l n="13">Sentit magnus Rex Francorum</l>
    <l n="14">tum sepło labiorum;</l>
    <l n="15">Præsens læthum vix evasit,</l>
    <l n="16">quod hic sacer ordo suasit.</l>
    <l n="17">Rex Anglorum est documento,</l>
    <l n="18">um Magnatum Parlamento.</l>
    <l n="19">Vnoq; ictu destinati</l>
    <l n="20">eci, Rex, Regina, Nati.</l>
    <l n="21">Horum grex hoc adornarat,</l>
    <l n="22">Garnetus comprobarat,</l>
    <l n="23">Cum Gerardo, cum Greenvvello,</l>
    <l n="24">cum perfido Cresvvello,</l>
    <l n="25">Omnes falli proditores,</l>
    <l n="26">liferorum seductores</l>
    <l n="27">Qui quod pijs præparârunt</l>
    <l n="28">se &amp; suos derivarunt.</l>
    <l n="29">Dum Romano famulantur,</l>
    <l n="30">Hispanis adulantur.</l>
    <l n="31">Nil nisi lites quærunt</l>
    <l n="32">e bellis bella serunt.</l>
    <l n="33">Testis bellum Hungarorum,</l>
    <l n="34">estis lites Polonorum</l>
    <l n="35">Et Ruffotum dira pestis</l>
    <l n="36">argus nostris dictis testis.</l>
    <l n="37">Nam cur aulas frequentatis,</l>
    <l n="38">ures principum captatis,</l>
    <l n="39" type="heading" level="1" para="true">SUPPLICATIONES</l>
    <l n="40" type="heading" level="2" para="true">D PAVLVM V. PONTIFICEM</l>
    <l n="41">torem Aug. Reges Franciæ &amp; Hispaniæ</l>
    <l n="42">pro Reformatione, seu</l>
    <l n="43">tione ad primum</l>
    <l n="44">nis Iesu</l>
    <l n="45" para="true">IAM omnia quæ ab initio huius</l>
    <l n="46">Trium Vimus, cum ita se habeant, ut hab</l>
    <l n="47">Nisi ut dolos necteretis,</l>
    <l n="48">Et secreta proderetis?</l>
    <l n="49">Iesus docet ignorantes,</l>
    <l n="50">Et attollit laborantes;</l>
    <l n="51">I-</l>
    <l n="52">gnorantes isti incantant,</l>
    <l n="53">Laborantesæ̨ supplantant.</l>
    <l n="54">Ignoranti nugas vendunt,</l>
    <l n="55">Imprudenti rete tendunt,</l>
    <l n="56">Tam nummorum appetentes,</l>
    <l n="57">Quam salutis negligentes.</l>
    <l n="58">Hinc moribundos fascinant</l>
    <l n="59">Et cor aegrorum lancinant,</l>
    <l n="60">Non ut ferant levamentum,</l>
    <l n="61">Sed ut auferant argentum.</l>
    <l n="62">Sic professi paupertatem,</l>
    <l n="63">Et crepantes egestatem,</l>
    <l n="64">Arcas suas implevere</l>
    <l n="65">Opibus, quas corrasere.</l>
    <l n="66">Iesus non vult superbire</l>
    <l n="67">Suos nec faštu prurire,</l>
    <l n="68">Sed suadens humilitatem</l>
    <l n="69">Omnes docet lenitatem.</l>
    <l n="70">Quid istis arrogantius?</l>
    <l n="71">Quid istis petulantius?</l>
    <l n="72">Dum detrectant alienis,</l>
    <l n="73">Sua laudant buccis plenis.</l>
    <l n="74">Bonosæ̨ calumniantur,</l>
    <l n="75">Dum de bonis mutuantur,</l>
    <l n="76">Neve advertant hi qui legunt,</l>
    <l n="77">Probris sua furta tegunt.</l>
    <l n="78">Gratis legunt, gratis docent,</l>
    <l n="79">Aurum legunt, viro nocent:</l>
    <l n="80">Cum promittant cuncta gratis</l>
    <l n="81">Nulla merces ipsis satis.</l>
    <l n="82">Vt a luce lucus dictus,</l>
    <l n="83">Et ut homo est, homo pictus:</l>
    <l n="84">Sic a Iesu, Iesuita,</l>
    <l n="85">Quem, si sapis, semper vita.</l>
    <l n="86" type="heading" level="1" para="true">THEOPHILI EVGENII</l>
    <l n="87" type="heading" level="2" para="true">ROM. ITEMQVE AD IMPERA-</l>
    <l n="88" type="heading" level="2">TORES, Albaniae, omnesque Principes Christianos ...</l>
    <l n="89" type="heading" level="2">redintegratione &amp; restaura-</l>
    <l n="90" type="heading" level="2">tione ... institutum Ordinem</l>
    <l n="91" type="heading" level="2">Iesuitarum.</l>
    <l n="92" para="true">Tractatus Iesuitici hucusque commemora-</l>
    <l n="93">rent certissime, non immerito</l>
    <l n="94">Theophi-</l>
